    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Instructions \n**Create an 'Event Created' Webhook**\nhttps://developer.getadministrate.com/docs/core/Webhooks/02_setup.md\n1. Set the url to the n8n url that's provided when creating the Webhook node.\n2. Set the query to \"query test($objectid: ID!){ node(id: $objectid) { id ... on Event{ id courseTemplate{id} location{id} }}}\"\n\n\n**Set how many Approved Instructors to add**\nIn the \"Number of Instructors to Add\" node, change the Max Items to how many Instructors you'd like added to the Event by default.",
        "height": 368,
        "width": 416
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -224,
        -16
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "566ca04f-357d-4a9a-84b3-c0f2e5831d6a",
      "name": "Sticky Note3"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## What Does It Do?\nWhen an Event is created, the Event's Course Approved Instructors are automatically added to the Personnel table of the Event Setup tab. \n\nThe Approved Instructors are checked for their availability before being added to the Event, the default is the 1st available Approved Instructor will be added but you can customise if you want more than 1.\n\n_Please note: if an Event is created via 'Duplicate' feature, any Instructors on the original Event will be carried over to the newly created Event regardless if they are available or not_",
        "height": 304,
        "width": 416,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
